          "relevance": 4.059,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "To export one project as CSV, open the project menu and choose Export, then CSV. Any member of the project can do this on every plan. The CSV has one row per task and subtask, with comments in a single column."
        },
