          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "To set up SSO, a workspace owner opens Settings, then Security, then Single sign-on, and copies Fernway's ACS URL and entity ID into a new SAML app in the identity provider. Then paste the provider's metadata URL back into Fernway and choose Test connection."
        },
