          "freshness": "2026-08-25T11:00:00Z",
          "relevance": 3.275,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "SCIM provisioning creates, updates and deactivates Fernway members from your identity provider. Generate a SCIM token under Single sign-on, then SCIM, and paste it with the SCIM base URL into Okta or Entra ID. Deactivating a user in the identity provider removes their seat in Fernway within minutes."
        },
